Package: SynthONA
Title: A Parameterised Protocol for Synthetic Organisational Network Benchmarks
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Silvia I.", "Fierascu",
           email = "silvia.fierascu@e-uvt.ro",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Generates synthetic organisational network analysis (ONA)
    benchmark datasets from an explicit, reproducible parameter
    specification. Networks are calibrated on target mean degree rather
    than fixed tie probability, so datasets remain comparable across
    organisation sizes. Every dataset ships with the ground truth used to
    build it -- planted community structure, brokers and articulation
    points -- together with an optional measurement layer that applies
    survey non-response, name-generator truncation and recall bias, so
    that method performance can be scored against a known answer.
    Includes an industry-template attribute model, a registry of
    organisational scenarios, multi-layer and longitudinal generation,
    weighted network metrics and validation reporting.
